  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthened institutional capacity of workers&apos; organizations</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The CPO contributes to the National Vision: Strong economy, A fully open country; Outcome 2. Ageing society, health, and labour market reforms

Principal milestones are:

Validation workshop (Rescheduled): Research Paper on Trade Union Unity - Target Date: To be determined in 2024 (Reason: Update needed as May 2022 has already passed)
Strengthen social dialogue amongst workers&apos; organisations and formalisation of Conseil des Syndicats: Target Date: December 2024 (Reason: Maintain the original target date if still achievable in 2024)
Capacity building and strengthening of SATUCC affiliates on the role of trade unions in achieving Agenda 2030 and decent work through the United Nations cooperation: Target Date: New Date Needed (Reason: Update needed as March 2022 has already passed. Consider proposing a new date in 2024)
Extending social protection and social development to informal economy workers and migrant workers: Target Date: New Date Needed (Reason: Update needed as December 2023 has already passed. Consider proposing a new date in 2024)</narrative>
  </description>
